Fri Oct 16 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - kris <kris@opensuse.org>

- Add non-fatal preflight diagnostic audit and multi-error reporting.
- Switch libxml2-tools dependency to /usr/bin/xmllint.
- Set umask 022 to avoid restricted permissions on updated targets.
- Increase default OPERATION_TIMEOUT to 900s for large upgrades.
- Enforce snapshot_is_bootable postcondition in commit_target.
- Support direct recovery rollback from pending-reboot on active TARGET.
- Add regression coverage for pending-reboot rollback (22 review tests).
- Export fixed PATH at script start (/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin).
- Remove redundant intermediate verify_cli_surface calls outside preflight.
- Clarify in rollback messages to run recover after reboot.
- Guard directory deletion in prune with explicit conditional.
- Restore line continuations across commands for improved readability.

